@baseUrl = http://localhost:18081

### 沿用 auth/knowledge 请求中取得的 token、kbId、docId；先解析并切分文档。
### 此操作调用真实 Embedding 服务，相同版本及模型成功后重复请求复用。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/{{docId}}/index
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 索引状态；换模型后旧空间会显示待处理
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/documents/{{docId}}/index
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 检索预览：仅调用问题 Embedding，不调用聊天模型
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge-bases/{{kbId}}/search
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"星河学习项目的验收口令是什么？"}

### 带来源的完整回答；与普通聊天分开使用会话编号
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversationId":"http-rag-study","knowledgeBaseId":{{kbId}},"question":"星河学习项目的验收口令是什么？"}

### 同一知识库会话的流式回答；done 包含 answer 和 sources
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{"conversationId":"http-rag-study","knowledgeBaseId":{{kbId}},"question":"根据资料，负责人是谁？"}

### 问答与来源快照；历史来源不随重新切分改写
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/conversations/http-rag-study/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
